 Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus who requires specific nutritional formulas.", "QT:QT refers to chemotherapy, which is also associated with complications in patients requiring nutritional support.", "NUTRICIÓN EN EL PACIENTE ONCOLÓGICO:Nutritional guidelines for oncology patients that include recommendations for managing head and neck neoplasias.", "NEOPLASIAS DE ORL:", "ÁNGELA MARTÍN PALMERO:Dra. Ángela Martín Palmero is the scientific director and head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital San Pedro in La Rioja.", "JULIA OCÓN BRETÓN:Dra. Julia Ocón Bretón is the scientific director and head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital Clínico Universitario Lozano Blesa in Zaragoza.", "FENANDO L. CALVO GRACIA:Dr. Fernando L. Calvo Gracia is the author of a clinical case study on nutritional management of a patient with a pancreatic tumor.", "ÁNGELA GONZÁLEZ DÍAZ-FAES:Dra. Ángela González Díaz-Faes is a specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition at Hospital Universitario Marqués de Valdecilla in Santander. She is also the author of a clinical case study that focuses on nutritional support for a diabetic patient suffering from head and neck cancer.", "SARA VALLE RODRÍGUEZ-NAVAS:Dra. Sara Valle Rodríguez-Navas is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition, dedicated to managing the nutritional care of her patients. She has contributed to the field through her research, notably authoring a clinical case study that focuses on the nutritional management of a patient with type 1 diabetes and rumination syndrome.", "NUTRITIONAL INTERVENTIONS IN HEAD AND NECK CANCER PATIENTS:A narrative review discussing various nutritional interventions for patients undergoing treatment for head and neck cancer.", "DIABETES MELLITUS AND IMPAIRED GLUCOSE REGULATION IN SPAIN:A study examining the prevalence of diabetes mellitus and impaired glucose regulation in Spain, providing insights into nutritional management for affected patients."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}